    "status": "locality_tradeoff_against_elastic_only",
    "paper_claim": "On this same-version W1 single-run comparison, ElasticLocality reduces physical GPU-s by 3.463% relative to ElasticOnly and remains much better than Full on latency/SLO, but its P95 TTFT is 3.814% higher than ElasticOnly and joint SLO is lower by 0.075 percentage points. The data support a resource–tail-latency trade-off, not a uniform win or a claim that locality alone explains Full.",
